@startuml Trade Submission - Rejected

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

actor Client
participant GatewayService
participant IngressService
participant Nginx
participant TradeController
participant TradeCommandService
participant TradeRepository
participant TradeAuditLogRepository
database Redis
database MySQL
database MongoDB

Client -> GatewayService: POST /api/trades\n(TradeDto, source)
activate GatewayService

GatewayService -> GatewayService: Rate limit check
activate GatewayService
GatewayService -> Redis: Check rate limit
Redis --> GatewayService: Rate limit status
deactivate GatewayService

GatewayService -> IngressService: Route request
activate IngressService

IngressService -> IngressService: Circuit breaker check
activate IngressService
deactivate IngressService

IngressService -> Nginx: POST /api/trades\n(TradeDto, source)
activate Nginx

Nginx -> TradeController: POST /api/trades\n(TradeDto, source)
activate TradeController

TradeController -> TradeCommandService: submitTrade(tradeDto, source)
activate TradeCommandService

alt Past Maturity Date
    TradeCommandService -> TradeCommandService: isPastMaturity(maturityDate)
    activate TradeCommandService
    TradeCommandService --> TradeCommandService: true
    deactivate TradeCommandService
    
    TradeCommandService -> TradeCommandService: handleRejection(tradeDto, source, PAST_MATURITY)
    activate TradeCommandService
    
else Lower Version
    TradeCommandService -> TradeRepository: findMaxVersionByTradeId(tradeId)
    activate TradeRepository
    TradeRepository -> MySQL: SELECT MAX(version)
    MySQL --> TradeRepository: Optional<Integer> maxVersion
    TradeRepository --> TradeCommandService: Optional<Integer> maxVersion
    deactivate TradeRepository
    
    TradeCommandService -> TradeCommandService: Check version < maxVersion
    activate TradeCommandService
    TradeCommandService --> TradeCommandService: true
    deactivate TradeCommandService
    
    TradeCommandService -> TradeCommandService: handleRejection(tradeDto, source, LOWER_VERSION)
    activate TradeCommandService
end

TradeCommandService -> TradeCommandService: createAuditLog(...)
activate TradeCommandService
TradeCommandService -> TradeAuditLogRepository: save(auditLog)
activate TradeAuditLogRepository
TradeAuditLogRepository -> MongoDB: INSERT audit log\n(validationStatus=REJECTED)
MongoDB --> TradeAuditLogRepository: TradeAuditLog
TradeAuditLogRepository --> TradeCommandService: TradeAuditLog
deactivate TradeAuditLogRepository
deactivate TradeCommandService

note right: Rejected trades are NOT saved to:\n- MySQL\n- Redis\n- Kafka

TradeCommandService -> TradeCommandService: Build TradeSubmissionResponse\n(status=REJECTED)
deactivate TradeCommandService

TradeCommandService --> TradeController: TradeSubmissionResponse
deactivate TradeCommandService

TradeController --> Nginx: TradeSubmissionResponse
deactivate TradeController

Nginx --> IngressService: TradeSubmissionResponse
deactivate Nginx

IngressService --> GatewayService: TradeSubmissionResponse
deactivate IngressService

GatewayService --> Client: 400 Bad Request\nTradeSubmissionResponse
deactivate GatewayService

@enduml

